flowchart TB
    A[Inbound message] --> B[Save original request\nas process variable]
    B --> C[Frends.Soap.Request\ncall SecureStockQuoteService\nWS-Security — pending SYN-100 branch resolution]
    C --> D[Extract SecureAmount\nsave secure response]
    D --> E[HTTP.Request Task\ncall SimpleStockQuoteService\nwith saved original request]
    E --> F[Extract SimpleAmount\nsave simple response]
    F --> G{Decision:\nSimpleAmount > SecureAmount?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Return simple response]
    G -->|No| I[Return secure response]
